<title>KUWAIT: Kuwait T-bill balance falls in Dec month/month.</title>
<headline>Kuwait T-bill balance falls in Dec month/month.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The outstanding balance of treasury bills issued by Kuwait's Central Bank fell to 1.167 billion dinars at the end of December from 1.246 billion the previous month, a Central Bank bulletin said.</p>
<p>The outstanding balance of public debt instruments -- bonds and bills -- fell to 2.494 billion dinars at the end of December from 2.573 billion at the end of November.</p>
<p>The balance of public debt instruments was 2.832 billion in December 1995.</p>
<p>				 Data in million dinars</p>
<p>				December '96	  December '95</p>
<p>Bills</p>
<p>  Matured		     385.0		   411.4</p>
<p>  New Issue		   306.4		   429.1</p>
<p>  Balance		   1,167.2		 2,023.1</p>
<p>Bonds</p>
<p>  Matured			--		     --</p>
<p>  New Issue		    --		     --</p>
<p>  Balance		   1,327.0		   809.2</p>
<p>Slight discrepancies in figures are due to rounding.</p>
</text>
